[{"sha":"53f7a1cf7c977793e06206fd15963999f086540d","node_id":"C_kwDOS_dMANoAKDUzZjdhMWNmN2M5Nzc3OTNlMDYyMDZmZDE1OTYzOTk5ZjA4NjU0MGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Vajrapu Venkata Bhasvanth Dev","email":"157608971+Bhasvanth-Dev9380@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-13T00:43:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Vajrapu Venkata Bhasvanth Dev","email":"157608971+Bhasvanth-Dev9380@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-13T00:43:16Z"},"message":"feat: agent-scope fix, skill grants, org-access visibility, OAuth tool, web-search fallback chain, connect command, and runtime hardening\n\n- resolveDefaultAgentId: always fall back to \"main\", never an arbitrary\n  cfg.agents key — the old first-key heuristic silently demoted \"main\"\n  once an org with 20+ agents was created\n\n- skill grants (grant.ts + skill-manifest.ts): operator pre-approves a\n  skill's command manifest in bulk; snapshot-copy into exec-approvals so\n  later skill edits can't silently widen the grant; revoke removes them\n\n- org-access skill visibility (org-access.ts): agents can see workspace\n  skills of their subordinates / managers via the policy org graph;\n  gated on skills.orgAccess.enabled\n\n- oauth_authorize tool: first-class OAuth 2.0 PKCE loopback flow;\n  listen(0) eliminates EADDRINUSE; two-phase start/await works over chat;\n  tokens and PKCE verifier never appear in results or logs\n\n- web_search: provider fallback chain; rate-limit cooldown (10 min) so\n  a capped provider doesn't burn every search; explicit override-not-\n  configured warning instead of silent rerouting; lead-scout + oauth-\n  setup bundled skills\n\n- connect command: new brigade connect flow (211 LOC)\n\n- misc: agent-loop / subagent-runner / spawn-agents / session-wiring /\n  extension registry / approval-bridge / console-stream / protocol\n  hardening and test coverage","tree":{"sha":"cf64034c0961543d67cb691505aa77e6c633abd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spinabot/brigade/git/trees/cf64034c0961543d67cb691505aa